---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Pillars from "../components/Pillars.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/url";
---

<Base
  title="Simon Gibson — Security leadership, now building with the models"
  description="25 years building and securing the infrastructure of the modern internet. Bloomberg's first CISO, Gigamon Fellow, running a fleet of AI agents in production and showing defenders what these models can do."
>
  <Hero />

  <hr class="rule wrap" style="max-width: var(--maxw);" />

  <Pillars />

  <hr class="rule wrap" style="max-width: var(--maxw);" />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap thesis">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">The pivot, in one paragraph</p>
        <h2 class="thesis__head">
          The models are good at security work now. The missing piece is the
          person who can get it inside a regulated building.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="thesis__body">
        <p>
          The builders of frontier AI have done remarkable work on model-layer
          safety. What is still thin is the <strong>deployment-layer
          story</strong>: the one that lets a bank's CISO sign off on putting
          this technology to work inside a regulated institution, and then
          lets the security team use it to its fullest instead of fencing it
          off.
        </p>
        <p>
          That story needs someone who has lived on both sides. I've sat in
          the regulated-industry CISO chair at Bloomberg and run the ransomware
          program at the largest credit union in the US. And I know this
          technology from the inside, because I run a fleet of agents in
          production, I serve open models on my own GPU, and I've stood in
          front of rooms of security people and shown them, token by token,
          what a model is doing.
        </p>
        <p class="thesis__kick">
          I don't talk about AI. <strong>I run it, and I can show you how it works.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="thesis__cta">
          <a href={withBase("/build")} class="btn solid">What I ship <span class="arr">→</span></a>
          <a href={withBase("/contact")} class="btn">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .thesis {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .thesis__head {
    margin-top: 18px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 92px;
  }
  .thesis__body p {
    color: var(--silver);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .thesis__kick {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.3rem !important;
    color: var(--white) !important;
  }
  .thesis__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .thesis {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .thesis__head {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
